    "days" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "天"}}}},
    "Preparing a few approved questions while Prompti is open." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Prompti 正在应用打开期间准备几道通过审核的题目。"}}}},
    "Review mode" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "复习模式"}}}},
    "Questions you miss will appear here for a calm second look." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "做错的题会出现在这里，方便你从容回顾。"}}}},
    "Complete a practice set to build your travel phrase history." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "完成一组练习后，这里会记录你的旅行表达。"}}}},
    "Practice this question" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "练习这道题"}}}},
