    "Cancel generation" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "取消生成"}}}},
    "Your progress starts here" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "从这里开始积累进度"}}}},
    "Complete a scored question to unlock accuracy and weekly trends." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "完成一道计分题后即可查看正确率和每周趋势。"}}}},
    "Answered questions, excluding skips" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已作答题目，不含跳过"}}}},
    "Questions answered during the last 7 days" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "最近 7 天作答题目数"}}}},
    "Skipped and reported questions never reduce your accuracy." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "跳过和举报的题目不会降低正确率。"}}}},
    "Spoken answers with uncertain transcription are saved for practice but not scored." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "转写结果不确定的口语回答会保留用于练习，但不会计分。"}}}},
    "Base URL" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "基础 URL"}}}},
    "Model ID" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "模型 ID"}}}},
    "Replace API key" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "替换 API 密钥"}}}},
    "Connection verified. Structured Outputs enabled." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "连接已验证，已启用结构化输出。"}}}},
    "Connection verified. JSON mode will be used." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "连接已验证，将使用 JSON 模式。"}}}},
    "When enabled, Prompti may call your model while the app is active. This can use extra tokens and create provider charges." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "启用后，Prompti 可能会在应用处于前台时调用模型。这会消耗额外 token，并可能产生服务商费用。"}}}},
    "This device only" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "仅此设备"}}}},
    "iCloud private database" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "iCloud 私有数据库"}}}},
    "On this device" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "此设备"}}}},
    "Questions, attempts and progress use your private iCloud database. Keys never sync." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "题目、作答记录和进度会存储在你的 iCloud 私有数据库中。密钥永不同步。"}}}},
    "iCloud storage was unavailable when Prompti started, so learning data is being kept locally on this device. Keys never sync." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Prompti 启动时无法使用 iCloud 存储，因此学习数据目前仅保存在此设备。密钥永不同步。"}}}},
    "Run setup again?" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "重新运行初始设置？"}}}},
    "Your learning history stays saved. You will choose the destination, language and model again." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "学习记录会保留。你需要重新选择目的地、语言和模型。"}}}},
    "Delete the API key from this device?" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "从此设备删除 API 密钥？"}}}},
    "API key deleted from this device." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已从此设备删除 API 密钥。"}}}},
    "Extra model usage" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "额外模型用量"}}}},
    "Keep enabled" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "保持开启"}}}},
    "Turn off" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "关闭"}}}},
    "Preparing questions before you ask for them can consume additional tokens and may create charges from your model provider." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "提前准备题目会消耗额外 token，并可能产生模型服务商费用。"}}}},
    "Any destination" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "任意目的地"}}}},
    "中文 + English" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "中文 + English"}}}},
    "languages" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "语言"}}}},
    "local picks" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "当地场景"}}}},
    "You can change it for every practice set." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "每组练习都可以单独更改。"}}}},
    "Selected" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已选择"}}}},
    "Not selected" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "未选择"}}}},
    "Keys stay in your iPhone Keychain and never sync to iCloud." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "密钥仅保存在 iPhone 钥匙串中，永不同步到 iCloud。"}}}},
    "Private and on-device" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "私密的设备端模型"}}}},
