    "When enabled, Prompti may call your selected model while the app is open. This can use extra tokens and create provider charges." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "启用后，Prompti 可能会在应用打开时调用所选模型。这会消耗额外 token，并可能产生服务商费用。"}}}},
    "Skipped, reported and uncertain spoken answers never reduce your accuracy." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "跳过、举报以及转写不确定的口语回答都不会降低正确率。"}}}},
    "Step %lld of %lld" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "第 %1$lld 步，共 %2$lld 步"}}}},
    "A flight route arriving at a city" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "一条抵达城市的飞行路线"}}}},
