    "OpenRouter · Sign in" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "OpenRouter · 账号授权"}}}},
    "One account. More possibilities." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "一次连接，更多选择。"}}}},
    "GPT, Claude, Gemini and more" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "GPT、Claude、Gemini 等多种模型"}}}},
    "Reconnect OpenRouter" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "重新连接 OpenRouter"}}}},
    "Verify model" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "验证模型"}}}},
    "Connect with OpenRouter" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "通过 OpenRouter 连接"}}}},
    "More connection options" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "更多连接方式"}}}},
    "Sign in to another account" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "换一个账号登录"}}}},
    "Connected. Your model is ready." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "连接成功，可以开始练习了。"}}}},
    "Connect an account, or use your own API key." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "登录模型账号，或使用自己的 API 密钥。"}}}},
    "Your destination, language and scenes go to your selected provider. Credentials stay on this device. Model usage may use account credits." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "目的地、语言和场景会发送给你选择的服务商。连接凭据仅保存在本机，使用模型可能消耗账号额度。"}}}},
    "Sign in cancelled. You can try again whenever you’re ready." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已取消登录，准备好后可以再次连接。"}}}},
    "Unable to open secure sign in. Try again." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "暂时无法打开安全登录，请重试。"}}}},
    "Sign in was cancelled or not approved." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "登录已取消或未获授权，请重试。"}}}},
    "OpenRouter could not finish connecting this device. Try signing in again." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "OpenRouter 未能完成连接，请重新登录。"}}}},
    "Connect using an authorization code" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "使用授权码连接"}}}},
    "Manage OpenRouter account" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "管理 OpenRouter 账号"}}}},
    "Connect your account" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "连接你的账号"}}}},
    "If sign in cannot return to Prompti, use an authorization code instead." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "如果登录后无法自动返回 Prompti，可以使用授权码完成连接。"}}}},
    "1. Sign in securely in your browser." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "1. 在浏览器中安全登录。"}}}},
    "Approve Prompti, then copy the authorization code shown by OpenRouter." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "授权 Prompti 后，复制 OpenRouter 显示的授权码。"}}}},
    "Open secure sign in" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "打开安全登录"}}}},
    "2. Return here and paste the code." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "2. 返回此处并粘贴授权码。"}}}},
    "Authorization code" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "授权码"}}}},
    "Connect and verify" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "连接并验证"}}}},
    "The code expires after 10 minutes. Keep this page open while you sign in." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "授权码有效期为 10 分钟，登录时请保留此页面。"}}}},
    "Connect a model in Settings to continue." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "请在设置中连接模型后继续。"}}}},
    "Your model connection has expired or was revoked. Reconnect in Settings." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "模型连接已失效或被撤销，请在设置中重新连接。"}}}},
    "Add credits to your model account, or choose another model in Settings." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "请为模型账号补充额度，或在设置中选择其他模型。"}}}},
    "Disconnect this model" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "断开当前模型连接"}}}},
    "Disconnected on this device. You can revoke the key in your provider account." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已断开本机连接。你也可以在服务商账号中撤销对应密钥。"}}}},
    "Your next chapter" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "下一站，新的故事"}}}},
    "A little practice. A world of confidence." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "练习一点，从容走远。"}}}},
    "Let’s get started" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "开启旅程"}}}},
    "Customize practice" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "自定义练习"}}}},
    "A small practice goes a long way." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "每天练一点，出发更从容。"}}}},
    "Start a set to build confidence for your next trip." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "从一组练习开始，为下一次旅行做好准备。"}}}},
    "Practice preferences" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "练习偏好"}}}}
